==== ReduceInfectionPower ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
A modifier that affects the speed of healing from an infection (From a normal infection, not from a zombie virus).
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReduceInfectionPower = 50,
</syntaxhighlight>
